From: Haruna Oseni <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 19:35:52 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix: update default rate limit from 2 to 10 req/s (#164)

---
 skills/resend/SKILL.md                       | 2 +-
 skills/resend/references/sending/overview.md | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/skills/resend/SKILL.md b/skills/resend/SKILL.md
index de7381f..449ce8a 100644
--- a/skills/resend/SKILL.md
+++ b/skills/resend/SKILL.md
@@ -277,7 +277,7 @@ See [webhooks.md](references/webhooks.md) for full details, signature verificati
 | 401 | Check API key — `restricted_api_key` means sending-only key used on non-sending endpoint |
 | 403 | Verify domain ownership — common causes: `resend.dev` sandbox, `from` domain mismatch, unverified domain |
 | 409 | Idempotency conflict — use new key or fix payload |
-| 429 | Rate limited — retry with exponential backoff (default rate limit: 2 req/s) |
+| 429 | Rate limited — retry with exponential backoff (default rate limit: 10 req/s) |
 | 500 | Server error — retry with exponential backoff |
 
 ## Resources
diff --git a/skills/resend/references/sending/overview.md b/skills/resend/references/sending/overview.md
index 64e7609..62e1c2f 100644
--- a/skills/resend/references/sending/overview.md
+++ b/skills/resend/references/sending/overview.md
@@ -11,7 +11,7 @@ Resend provides two endpoints for sending emails:
 
 **Choose batch when:**
 - Sending 2+ distinct emails at once
-- Reducing API calls is important (by default, rate limit is 2 requests per second)
+- Reducing API calls is important (by default, rate limit is 10 requests per second)
 - No attachments or scheduling needed
 
 **Choose single when:**
-- 
